WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.467
"The apples are gone!" cried Cow.

2
00:00:13.468 --> 00:00:17.617
"Who ate them?" said Bat.

3
00:00:17.618 --> 00:00:21.513
"I know who ate them!" said Cat.

4
00:00:21.514 --> 00:00:25.029
"I know too," said Cow.

5
00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:26.687
"It was—"

6
00:00:26.688 --> 00:00:30.385
"Pig!" cried Bat.

7
00:00:30.386 --> 00:00:37.634
"Why did you eat the apples, Pig?" said Cat.

8
00:00:37.635 --> 00:00:40.916
"I did not eat them," said Pig.

9
00:00:40.917 --> 00:00:44.703
"You ate them, Pig!" said Bat.

10
00:00:44.704 --> 00:00:48.563
"Do not tell a lie!" said Cow.

11
00:00:48.564 --> 00:00:53.694
" I did not eat the apples," said Pig.

12
00:00:53.695 --> 00:00:56.591
"The crows ate the apples."

13
00:00:56.592 --> 00:01:00.658
"The crows ate the apples?" said Cow.

14
00:01:00.659 --> 00:01:03.709
"Yes," said Pig.

15
00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:07.559
"I gave the apples to the crows."

16
00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:10.447
"Why?" said Bat.

17
00:01:10.448 --> 00:01:14.411
"The crows cannot eat the corn," said Pig.

18
00:01:14.412 --> 00:01:17.995
"So they are very hungry."

19
00:01:17.996 --> 00:01:21.981
"We are hungry too!" said Cat.

20
00:01:21.982 --> 00:01:24.492
"Here," said Pig.

21
00:01:24.493 --> 00:01:33.057
"I picked more apples."

22
00:01:33.058 --> 00:01:53.824
"You are a good friend, Pig," said Cow.

